# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  0bdef43 wwe2k14 Session 69 (review): ext_bits Known only when the epilogue specialisation was on at store time; TexMaskKnown keeps a draw's real 0 texture-sign mask at prewarm; draw jobs ahead of the prewarm backlog; worker count capped at 8
