#  06adec4 wwe2k14 Session 69: gpu_native_clip_disable_clamp (default true; false = the old clipped pipelines) for A/B checks
#  df4f03a wwe2k14 Session 69 (review): the clamp bit only where the device has depthClamp; comments
#  979d9f4 wwe2k14 Session 69: NATIVE pipelines clamp depth when the guest's clipping is off (PA_CL_CLIP_CNTL clip_disable), as the emulated pipeline does - the testers' red block: a colour-only clear with z a hair below 0 was depth-clipped whole in truth frames (RenderDoc pixel history)
#  bfe300b wwe2k14 Session 69: diagnostic gpu_native_truth_debug_renderdoc - a RenderDoc capture from the red block's strip clear to two frames later
#  219a1d7 wwe2k14 Session 69: red-block diagnostic - the span's TruthStoreMany decisions
#  14990a6 wwe2k14 Session 69: red-block diagnostic - mask, blend, viewport, scissor, pipeline of the logged draws
#  1525aae wwe2k14 Session 69: the red-block diagnostic also logs the draws of a pass of that pitch (rect, images, touched / new tiles, tile column 12)
#  bf0d7dc wwe2k14 Session 69: diagnostic gpu_native_truth_debug_span_pitch - a staged span's tile owners (the red block's resolve)

